        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YEVY44-FMT, Everly Entry Door Handleset with Farmington Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Everly Handleset with Farmington Lever was made for your traditional home. Imagine coming home and seeing all the history associated with these classic shapes. The arched detail for the Everly emphasises the refinement of traditional New England--the American colonial heartland. The Everly Entry Door Handleset with Farmington Lever is available in all the most popular finish colors and will fit many pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Expressions Everly Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 2”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YEVY44-FMT-specifications.pdf?v=1704262433\"><b>Yale YEVY44-FMT Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
